# A83 (our desktop, sd-base, no #Z): the C:\ window is open at boot at
# (48,43). Park the pointer bottom-right (never through the menu bar), dump the
# idle desktop, double-click the ACC folder icon (94,104) in the boot window
# -> open_dir_window: a C:\ACC\ window opens staggered at (72,67) with its
# title/info from the WNode buffers; park, dump. Then click that window's
# closer (83,78 = (72+2, 67+2) + 9 into the 19x19 cell) -> WM_CLOSED ->
# do_close_folder -> navigate_window: the same window, same WNode, title
# rewritten in place to C:\ (the AES reads the pointer live); park, dump twice.
# Ticks are 200 Hz after "[desk] desktop up" (A46 dual arming).
200 parkbr
1100 mark A_IDLE
1400 move 94 104
1600 down
1603 up
1608 down
1611 up
2000 parkbr
2600 mark B_FOLDER
3000 move 83 78
3200 down
3203 up
3600 parkbr
4200 mark C_NAVIGATED
4600 mark D_NAVIGATED_2S
